    "diagnosis": "ALK-positive anaplastic large cell lymphoma (ALCL)",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Neoplastic cells demonstrating a sinusoidal growth pattern highlighted by strong, uniform expression of CD30 (&lt;&lt;31029&gt;&gt;). Infiltration in the skin shows uniform and strong expression of CD30 in the perifollicular region. The hair follicle epithelium and endothelial cells are negative for CD30 (&lt;&lt;31031&gt;&gt;). Tumour cell infiltration in the lymph node demonstrates strong and uniform expression of CD30 and highlights sheets and intrasinusoidal extension (&lt;&lt;31032&gt;&gt;). Strong nuclear and cytoplasmic expression of ALK is observed in ALCL with <em>NPM1</em>::<em>ALK</em> rearrangement (&lt;&lt;31033&gt;&gt;).",
    "source": "Kojo S.J. Elenitoba-Johnson",
